"P2959378836" "The Arachnos Invasion"
// DetailString :
"P4010486869" "It seems you and Aaron Thiery were too late to stop Arachnos! They've already gained a foothold within Argosy Industrial and are trying to push forward!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArachnosClue2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
