// IntroString :
"P1517717655" "Matthew Habashy has informed me about what you know, which is that <color red>Arachnos</color> has been trying to destabilize the area of Atlas. An interesting idea, to say the least, attacking the heart of a city of heroes.<br><br>I have been keeping my eye on peculiar events. I believe I know where we may be able to strike to prevent Arachnos from attaining its goal of total dominion over Atlas Park."
// AcceptString :
"P4115600067" "What do you know?"
// SendOffString :
"P323389310" "There has been a large gathering of Hellions in the northern part of <color yellow>Argosy Industrial</color>. The area was once the center of industrial work in Paragon, but that honor has since gone to <color yellow>Independence Port</color>. The mostly empty warehouses there are now being used by the Hellions.<br><br>I've deduced that it's highly possible the Hellions are setting the stage for Arachnos to use those warehouses for some sort of invasion.<br><br>I would suggest a full out attack on the Hellions to prevent this from happening."
// TaskTitle :
"P2379721727" "<color deepskyblue>Reason to Fight</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3039495976" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: The Tide</color>"

