// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1780245209" "Explosives? It seems Arachnos is intent on leveling all of Atlas. Very interesting indeed."
// zowiedisplayname :
"P640910118" "Hidden Explosive"
// zowiedescription :
"P820825591" "Find {Remain} more hidden explosives!"
// zowiesingulardescription :
"P2627819007" "One hidden explosive still remains!"
// interactbeginstring :
"P4265604424" "You begin to disarm the explosive..."
// interactinterruptedstring :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// interactcompletestring :
"P3848650341" "You've disarmed the explosive!"
// interactactionstring :
"P1388010237" "Disarming..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2118842141" "You've disarmed the explosives!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2597136737" "It is a good thing you've stopped the bombing plot, {HeroName}. It seems, though, we are no further to finding out where the Arachnos base is.<br><br>There are a few heroes who have answered the call to help fight off Arachnos, but there are still many who have refused to. Many believe they are not 'good' enough to make a difference.<br><br>It is unreasonable, really, to believe that just because you have super abilities that you are a super hero. And because of that, we find ourselves in our current situation. Let us see what you can do to get us out of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - THIERY3VAR 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2017028702" "Did you, by chance, see large Arachnos Pylons? I've received some data from Matthew Habashy that these pylons are being used as a method of communication.<br><br>Arachnos sends their data through numerous pylons in order to hide exactly where their data center is located.<br><br>It is reasonable, then, to assume that if enough of these pylons are destroyed, we would be able to predict with greater accuracy where the main Arachnos base is."
// AcceptString :
"P1579060795" "How many of these need to be destroyed?"
// SendOffString :
"P3724564209" "According to my predictions, I would say three. There are several other heroes working on tracking down the location, as well as taking down the pylons. But you, {HeroName}, are at the forefront of it.<br><br>I will let Matthew Habashy know to contact me when the scientists at SERAPH and the agents in the FBSA have pin-pointed the location of the Arachnos base."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3553304543" "Destroy Arachnos Pylons"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3845296951" "There are still too many pylons up for us to accurately predict where their base is hidden."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1735632574" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Chance to Make Things Different</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccessNoFlashback 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3474950592" "You destroyed the pylons and received an alarming message from Matthew Habashy!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1061404859" "Hrm. This is... unexpected. Who would have thought that a normal man like Matthew Habashy would run off to do something so brave? I definitely did not believe it would happen.<br><br>Yes, it is no surprise the Arachnos base would be heavily fortified. It is their main method of conducting this invasion. I suppose it also makes sense for them to keep their prisoners there as well.<br><br>Habashy's plan could just work. Arachnos would be pleased to get their hands on an FBSA agent, enough that they would lower their guard, focusing on bringing him in. That would be the time for you to strike."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Habashy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3015813880" "Hey... {HeroName}... man... you're sure a sight... for sore eyes. And boy... are my eyes sore... and my chest... my legs... basically... sort of everything... is hurting really bad...<br><br>Looks like... the plan worked out... pretty well, huh?"
// Answer Text :
"P2472519223" "Matthew, that was crazy! You could've been killed, what were you thinking?"
// Answer Text :
"P240617224" "You did a brave thing, Matthew. Not a lot of people would've tried that."
// Page Scolds Text :
"P1775638833" "Had to do it... {HeroName}... I couldn't get the image of my wife's face... when she and I split in Galaxy... I wanted to do something... something to save her...<br><br>As soon as I saw... that we had her location... I didn't care if I died or not... I had to at least... at least <i>try</i> to save her... and to try to help you save everyone...<br><br>It's... it's not over yet though... the mole... it was... it was <color yellow>Aaron Thiery</color> all along...!"
// Answer Text :
"P1906860632" "What? Thiery? He was the one who told me about the mole!"
// Page Understands Text :
"P3982753635" "Hah... thanks... {HeroName}... looks like we're both on the same page with this... thing... huh...?<br><br>I think I... earned some major... points with the wife... for doing this... ha... haha... Urgh...<br><br>There's no time... to rest now... I'll... be fine... you've got to go after the mole. It's... it's <color yellow>Aaron Thiery</color>...! He betrayed us all... he... he was the one helping Arachnos all this time...!"
// Answer Text :
"P409624464" "Thiery? He was the one who told me about the mole!"
// Page Betrayal Text :
"P2118978824" "I don't know... What he's up to... why he betrayed us. He even told Arachnos... that you <i>wouldn't</i> be coming. It's like... he wants you to succeed or something... but... he told Arachnos all about our weaknesses... when we'd be vulnerable... he even... told them to hold off on my execution for a few more minutes... and it was just... in time... for you to get here...<br><br>You've got... you've got to find him, {HeroName}... find out what... what he's up to...!"
// Answer Text :
"P802834390" "I'll handle this, don't worry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Thiery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3265673890" "{HeroName}. I assume you saved Habashy, given that you're here now. I also assume that he told you that he saw me.<br><br>I asked them to spare Habashy's life. While a coward for most of his life, Habashy took a stand, due to the example you set for him. And so, I decided to have his life intertwined with your choice. Had you decided not to show up or were killed, then he too would have been killed.<br><br>In a few moments, the commander in charge will show up to fight you. You will soundly defeat him, bringing an end to all of this, returning Atlas to its former peace."
// Answer Text :
"P2493808855" "Why? Why did you do all of this, Thiery?"
// Page Why Text :
"P823416634" "The heroes in this city became too complacent, {HeroName}. Too many left crimes unanswered, believing it was 'beneath' them. Too many simply went about living their lives as if they were normal, when they were <i>not</i>, when they had <i>responsibilities</i> to the people.<br><br>The heroes of this city needed to be shaken back awake, to realize their true role in this life. The destruction of Galaxy helped with this, but still, heroes in Atlas continued in their complacency. There needed to be a strike to the heart. And so, here we are."
// Answer Text :
"P666085356" "You had no right to do that, to do all of this!"
// Answer Text :
"P2336287254" "And so you think you're the good guy by joining Arachnos?"
// Page NoRight Text :
"P3271210268" "No, I had no right to do this. But I did it anyway. In dire times, someone must make a choice and do what is <i>wrong</i> in order for others to take a stand and do what is <i>right</i>.<br><br>Heroes will remember, for some time, that they must always be vigilant. That no part of the city is completely safe. They will stand and protect others, putting their own petty views or laziness behind them.<br><br>And you yourself have become a product of this. If it were not for the destruction of Galaxy, for the Arachnos intervention, would you have been stirred to action? To use your abilities for the good of mankind?"
// Answer Text :
"P4051808439" "I would've helped, regardless of the situation!"
// Page JoinArachnos Text :
"P4169252840" "I do not believe I am the good guy in this situation. Arachnos was a means to an end, a method to help wake up the heroes of this city, to remind them of their true calling.<br><br>Heroes will remember, for some time, that they must always be vigilant. That no part of the city is completely safe. They will stand and protect others, putting their own petty views or laziness behind them.<br><br>And you yourself have become a product of this. If it were not for the destruction of Galaxy, for the Arachnos intervention, would you have been stirred to action? To use your abilities for the good of mankind?"
// Page Where Text :
"P2924809202" "Perhaps, {HeroName}, that is what makes you stand out from the others.<br><br>But many started out just like you, I am sure; eyes full of wonder, your heart bursting with the desire to save the city, the state, the country, the <i>world</i>. But how many times can you do this? Once? Twice?<br><br>It will eventually wear down on you, and you will give in to apathy, like so many others before you. And then, someone like myself will come along and help reawaken you.<br><br>I have, {HeroName}, one final request for you."
// Answer Text :
"P3129688075" "You? Have a request for -me-?"
// Page Request Text :
"P3781327306" "Kill me.<br><br>What I have done is unforgivable. I do not deserve to live in the same world as these people, not after what I've helped trigger. It is not true justice if I survive and all the innocent die.<br><br>Deliver the final call of justice to me and seal your role as a hero, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P982067622" "You brought this upon yourself! (Kill Thiery)"
// Answer Text :
"P1452570019" "No. You'll pay for your crimes like all the others. (Arrest Thiery)"
// Page KillThiery Text :
"P3770296262" "<color orange>You strike down Thiery, ending his life!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page ArrestThiery Text :
"P3266218385" "<color orange>You arrest Thiery, ensuring that he'll pay for all the crimes he has committed.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Habashy2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page KilledThiery Text :
"P3344066980" "Looks like everything worked out okay, huh, {HeroName}?<br><br>Atlas Park is safe from Arachnos, <i>I'm</i> alive, and I just might've saved my marriage by doing something that I think would classify as, 'stupidly brave'.<br><br>What happened with Aaron Thiery?"
// Answer Text :
"P277449976" "I killed him. He caused too much pain to be left alive."
// Answer Text :
"P4237139923" "Arachnos killed him."
// Page DidntKillThiery Text :
"P2244696823" "Looks like everything worked out okay, huh, {HeroName}?<br><br>Atlas Park is safe from Arachnos, <i>I'm</i> alive, and I just might've saved my marriage by doing something that I think would classify as, 'stupidly brave'.<br><br>I'm happy that Aaron Thiery is going to spend a <i>very</i> long time rotting in the darkest part of the Zig. I might even go visit him, just to spite him.<br><br>What plans do you have for yourself now, {HeroName}? After the whole, you know, saving Atlas Park from the brink of destruction against Arachnos."
// Answer Text :
"P141548389" "Continue to fight crime. The fight isn't over yet."
// Answer Text :
"P2830032789" "I think I'll finally -relax-. Even if it's not for very long."
// Answer Text :
"P4038934543" "I'm sure something will come up. I didn't exactly plan to save Atlas Park."
// Page IKilledHim Text :
"P2786085805" "Oh. Well... that's really taking things into your own hands.<br><br>I can't really blame you, though. Aaron used all of us, he acted like he was our <i>friend</i> and then acted against us the entire time. Honestly, I think you were right in that, {HeroName}.<br><br>But hey, let's try to keep this cheery! The day's saved, the FBSA is covering my hospital bill, and my wife is willing to take me back.<br><br>What are you going to do now?"
// Page ArachnosKilledHim Text :
"P3691587674" "Hrmph, good riddance, I say. The guy used all of us for his own ends. I just wish I could've been there when they took him out.<br><br>Or at least, asked him <i>how</i> he could've done everything that he did.<br><br>But hey, let's try to keep this cheery! The day's saved, the FBSA is covering my hospital bill, and my wife is willing to take me back.<br><br>What are you going to do now?"
// Page MoreForMeToDo Text :
"P1812244971" "You're right, {HeroName}, that I have no doubt of.<br><br>Even now, <color yellow>Kings Row</color> could probably use your help.<br><br>But hey, keep in touch, alright? I'd like to think we've sort of become friends in all of this. Hopefully you won't have to come bail me out of any more problems!"
// Answer Text :
"P148430194" "I'll keep in touch, Matthew. Take care of yourself."
// Page JustRelax Text :
"P3533755221" "Hah! I bet it won't be for too long, knowing how things go around here.<br><br>But relaxing just for a few minutes isn't necessarily a bad thing, makes you appreciate the quieter moments, eh?<br><br>Whatever you do, just make sure to keep in touch, alright? I'd like to think that we're friends now, what with you helping me to save my marriage and all."
// Answer Text :
"P2754757082" "Don't worry, I'll stay in touch. Take care of yourself, and your wife!"
// Page SomethingWillComeUp Text :
"P1652713377" "That's true, nobody really plans on being a hero, huh? Pretty wise words.<br><br>I get the feeling that you're going to be at the center of a <i>lot</i> of things to come, {HeroName}. You've got that aura around you.<br><br>But hey, just make sure to keep in touch, okay? We've both been through a lot together, I'd like to think we've become what people around here call friends. Heck, you helped save my marriage! But anyway, I'll let you go now. Take it easy, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2248114665" "I'll keep in touch. Take care of yourself, Matthew."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2073166203" "I've received the exact location of where the Arachnos base is. The FBSA has confirmed Matthew Habashy has gone MIA.<br><br>I can only assume that he is currently within the bowels of the base.<br><br>I would hurry, if I were you. Habashy plans on using his position in the FBSA as leverage, hoping they will keep him alive long enough for you to arrive. But I do not believe that will work."
// AcceptString :
"P9009921" "What? Why will that not work?"
// SendOffString :
"P2042001843" "<color red>Arachnos already has an agent on the inside.</color> It is how they were able to get into Atlas Park so easy.<br><br>It is also how they knew about the meteor strike in Galaxy City. Arachnos was in Galaxy mere minutes after the meteors hit. That is no coincidence, {HeroName}, and Arachnos is not that well-organized that they could pull it off themselves.<br><br>Someone within one of the organizations is helping them, and that is why <color yellow>Matthew Habashy will die.</color> If you do not hurry, that is."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1099552957" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: One Man's Savior, One City's Hero</color>"

