// SaysList :
"P1731449042" "<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>Can you hear me? {HeroName}? It's Matthew... I snuck a device on myself to-<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>You! The FBSA agent, get up! <t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>Look, I'll do whatever you want. Just let my wife and the others go! <t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Unfortunately for you, we already have a mole within SERAPH. We'll just make you into an example of what we do to so-called 'heroes'!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkCyan>SERAPH?! Please, just leave my wife al - AAAAGH!"
// SaysList :
"P551328958" "<t=6 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor Crimson>Our mole has arrived, we're moving to the next phase. Kill the FBSA agent and prep the remaining prisoners!"

